There is no active project Task Packet yet. Before non-trivial implementation,
record actual project requirements, authority, branch/base/head, allowed actions,
acceptance, checks, risk, roles and stops. Independently review the plan. Use separate
implementation, quality, independent Full review and triage sessions; repair only
confirmed findings and use scoped Delta review. Preserve stricter project rules.

Do not publish secrets or read credential files into prompts. A task-authorized
process may receive scoped credentials without exposing their raw values to the
model. Git ignore rules do not establish file permissions or OS isolation.
No merge, release, deployment, runner registration, protection change, credential
grant or automatic downstream apply follows from this seed. Human decisions and
actual revision-bound evidence remain required. Do not invent PASS or carry old
Backbone delivery records as current project authority.

Use [the project command map](docs/operations/development.md). Common managed files
are checked from a separately reviewed immutable source checkout; do not replace
existing source/legacy/project gates with this bounded seed verifier. Optional
quality/navigation/workflow/dependency activation requires its own reviewed
integration and actual execution evidence. Existing native files do not prove
host loading, model qualification or runtime isolation.
